vielotus (2.0.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.4:
    - Sync compound-head bilingual detection (miếng lót, hoa dơn, áo lót,
      etc.) between Swift and C++20 engines for consistent behavior across
      macOS, Windows, and Linux.
    - C++ engine: add toLowerVietnamese() for Unicode-capitalized compound
      heads, fix "downw" semantic saturation overflow, support "hoa lay dơn"
      two-word compound head.
    - Cross-engine parity gate: 59/59 ratified cases (100%).
    - Add benchmark_ratchet.sh, test_cross_engine_parity.py, and
      benchmark_mobile_path.sh to the public source tree.
  * Native C++20 regression suite: 100.00% (9,091/9,091) primary,
    100.00% (371/371) ambiguous_both_sides, 100.00% (179/179)
    whitelist_safe=never. Swift regression suite: 100.00% (9,091/9,091)
    primary, 97.84% (363/371) ambiguous_both_sides, 100.00% (179/179)
    whitelist_safe=never.
  * Debian packaging hygiene:
    - Do not install /etc/fonts/conf.d/51-vielotus-vietnamese.conf or
      /etc/xdg/autostart/vielotus-onboard.desktop in ibus-vielotus; respect
      system fontconfig policy and im-config/desktop input-source defaults.
    - Add 01-debian-disable-autoonboard-and-fontconfig.patch to drop the
      --auto-onboard login helper and Snap fontconfig sync from
      vielotus-settings and its manual page.

 -- Trần Phát Đạt (Steve Dat) <ttd1232004@gmail.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:10:00 +0700

vielotus (2.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.3 (incorporating 2.0.2 and 2.0.3 changes):
    - SEN Flex Policy 3B+ mark-only backspace (duocw + Backspace -> được),
      Telex horn propagation (dduwocj -> được, huwou -> hươu), tone-mark
      replacement and expressive vowel repeats (uwfaaa -> ừaaa), post-coda
      circumflex English preservation (theme vs theem -> thêm), ee/oo
      code-switching in English context, double-letter and camelCase English
      preservation (dessert, queue, saveFile), and "pía" syllable support.
    - Guard Wayland delete_surrounding_text bounds, harden KDE Plasma 6 Wayland
      virtual keyboard binding and GNOME input-source repair, and update
      Arch/rolling-release Linux CMake build support.
    - Native C++20 regression suite: 100.00% (9,091/9,091) primary,
      100.00% (373/373) ambiguous_both_sides, 100.00% (180/180)
      whitelist_safe=never. Swift regression suite: 100.00% (9,091/9,091)
      primary, 97.86% (365/373) ambiguous_both_sides, 100.00% (180/180)
      whitelist_safe=never.
  * Address DFSG NEW review items from 2.0.1-1 (#1152533 message #10) and
    tracker diagnostics:
    - Use mktemp -d (0700) with ownership/symlink guards and exit trap in
      vielotus-settings, use mkstemp (0600) for atomic config.env merges, and
      remove network update checks / external self-updater calls in favor of
      system package management (APT).
    - Drop redundant Recommends on the vielotus metapackage, ship dedicated
      fcitx-vielotus icons and per-engine typing-modes.yml paths so
      fcitx5-vielotus and ibus-vielotus work both standalone and co-installed,
      and ship /usr/bin/vielotus plus vielotus.1 manpage symlinks.
    - Update debian/watch to Version 5 and set Vcs-Git subpath
      [CrossPlatform/packaging] for vcswatch.
    - Replace legacy encoded arrays in VietnameseSyllableDictionary.swift and
      EmbeddedTestSuite.swift with plain UTF-8 source (DFSG #2), and add
      complete DEP-5 SCOWL attribution to debian/copyright.

 -- Trần Phát Đạt (Steve Dat) <ttd1232004@gmail.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 04:00:00 +0700

vielotus (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. (Closes: #1152533)
  * Official multi-arch (amd64 & arm64) release of Sen Việt (VieLotusIM).
  * Unobfuscated C++20 native engine with canonical UTF-8 (Unicode NFC)
    lexicon wordlists and build-time FNV-1a table generation (DFSG #2).
  * Native Fcitx5 addon (vielotus-telex, vielotus-vni) and IBus engine.
  * Ubuntu Language Support auto-registration for Vietnamese (vi).

